    <tags>file-manager file-explorer dual-panel cross-platform rust</tags>
    <summary>Lightweight dual-panel file explorer that looks identical on Windows, macOS and Linux</summary>
    <description>
A lightweight dual-panel file explorer that looks and behaves the same on
Windows, macOS and Linux. It is a single statically linked executable written
entirely in Rust and draws its own UI - no Qt, WebView or Electron.

Features: tabs, inline tree, preview pane (text, images, archive listings,
WASM plugins), built-in terminal, batch rename, checksums, duplicate finder,
folder compare and sync, fast copy (CopyFileEx with parallel small files),
favorites, trash with restore.

This package installs the per-machine MSI (Program Files). Versions 0.22.0 and
earlier used a per-user Inno Setup installer; it is removed automatically before
the MSI is installed. User settings are kept.

License: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 - free for noncommercial use only;
commercial use requires a license.
    </description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
